FROM ubuntu:26.04@sha256:f144425ff09be612d6d9ad965196e9cdc23dae1f42110a8a11a3e9a8198759f7
ENV DEBIAN_FRONTEND=noninteractive \
    TZ=UTC \
    LANG=C.UTF-8 \
    LC_ALL=C.UTF-8 \
    TMPDIR=/run/rahandaz-lab/tmp
RUN mkdir -p /run/rahandaz-lab/tmp /tmp \
    && TMPDIR=/tmp apt-get update \
    && TMPDIR=/tmp apt-get install -y --no-install-recommends python3 ca-certificates curl passwd \
    && rm -rf /var/lib/apt/lists/* \
    && printf '%s\n' '#!/bin/sh' 'exit 101' > /usr/sbin/policy-rc.d \
    && chmod 0755 /usr/sbin/policy-rc.d
COPY entrypoint.sh /usr/local/bin/rahandaz-lab-entrypoint
RUN chmod 0755 /usr/local/bin/rahandaz-lab-entrypoint
ENTRYPOINT ["/usr/local/bin/rahandaz-lab-entrypoint"]
